Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.64,0:00:10.98,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在心灵的街道中{\fad(250,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.78,0:00:17.45,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,闪耀着希望之光{\fad(0,250)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.26,0:00:23.66,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,用虚幻的羽翼挥动着梦想
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.56,0:00:29.97,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你与我寻找的目标
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.40,0:00:46.38,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真理总是隐藏在眼中 蓝蓝的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.02,0:00:53.25,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们要往何处去
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.33,0:01:00.03,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,俩人未来与现今的流浪{\fad(50,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.57,0:01:05.63,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们继续踏上旅程{\fad(0,50)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.91,0:01:12.61,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,永远的目标地 无止尽的梦
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.11,0:01:23.49,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,希望能不放手不断追寻 直到永远{\fad(0,1000)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.72,0:01:37.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.02,0:01:39.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快逃啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.99,0:01:43.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇姑娘
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.03,0:01:45.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.33,0:01:49.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就是想得到这女人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.91,0:02:00.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,第70话 再次苏醒的鬼蜘蛛记忆
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.53,0:02:04.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就是想得到你啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.50,0:02:07.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.83,0:02:08.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,浑蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.15,0:02:21.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇 快逃
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.69,0:02:32.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 不要阻碍我
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.06,0:02:36.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,站住
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.93,0:02:40.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么找上戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.73,0:02:41.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.43,0:02:44.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不对 那女人
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.08,0:02:51.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是我的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.41,0:02:54.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,臭家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.95,0:02:59.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,接招 风之伤
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.46,0:03:04.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,女人
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.63,0:03:10.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是…我的…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.17,0:03:22.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这家伙为什么想要抓戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.47,0:03:24.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,既然他背上有蜘蛛的伤痕
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.04,0:03:29.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无双应该是奈落的分身没错
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.38,0:03:33.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,正面承受风之伤
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.49,0:03:35.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,应该不可能还活着
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.49,0:03:37.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是总觉得…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.26,0:03:42.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错 未免太简单了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.63,0:03:44.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.00,0:03:49.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,枫姥姥
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.50,0:03:51.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到底发生了什么
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.54,0:03:54.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在已经太迟了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.04,0:03:56.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.57,0:03:57.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没什么
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.54,0:04:00.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,事情已经解决了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.01,0:04:03.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,应该是解决了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.69,0:04:12.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,身体还好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.26,0:04:14.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还好 托你的福
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.13,0:04:17.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,稍后再来换药吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.56,0:04:19.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桔梗姑娘
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.00,0:04:25.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.67,0:04:30.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在这里的话就不用担心了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.51,0:04:32.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无双师父
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.01,0:04:37.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的师父被杀害 脸被夺走了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.45,0:04:40.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真残忍 到底是什么人
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.32,0:04:42.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那家伙没有脸
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.32,0:04:46.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且背上有蜘蛛的图案
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.26,0:04:48.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,蜘蛛？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.46,0:04:52.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太可怕 太可怕了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.83,0:04:54.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,带他进去休息一下吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.83,0:04:55.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.54,0:04:59.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,背上有蜘蛛的图案
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.04,0:05:02.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落分身的杰作
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.91,0:05:08.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那家伙…又想做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.28,0:05:13.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桔梗…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.35,0:05:16.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.49,0:05:19.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你会在意我也是身不由己
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.62,0:05:20.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.99,0:05:26.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鬼蜘蛛的心依然强烈的残存在你的体内
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.51,0:05:43.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶 奈落那浑蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.21,0:05:45.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到底什么时候才要放了我
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.38,0:05:47.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.59,0:05:50.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,神乐
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.59,0:05:51.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.59,0:05:54.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想出去吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.53,0:05:58.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说过了 以后不会再逃了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.66,0:06:01.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去追一个叫无双的男人
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.60,0:06:02.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无双？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.73,0:06:05.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他也算是你的弟弟
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.41,0:06:10.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无双
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.84,0:06:13.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落的新分身？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.85,0:06:18.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后告诉犬夜叉他们无双的行踪
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.18,0:06:19.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.85,0:06:22.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然 那家伙会去的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.12,0:06:25.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是那里错不了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.44,0:06:41.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶 对我做这么过分的事
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.57,0:06:44.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那家伙是谁 犬夜叉…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.71,0:06:47.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.45,0:06:53.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我认识…那个家伙？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.95,0:06:59.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我…是谁…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.96,0:07:00.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再见啦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.83,0:07:02.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样真的好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.09,0:07:06.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错 你暂时回那边去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.73,0:07:07.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是难得
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.17,0:07:11.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你每次都说不要随便回去的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.40,0:07:13.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说了这次没关系啦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.97,0:07:14.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.97,0:07:16.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然我很在意考试结果
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.98,0:07:19.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以很感谢你让我回去啦…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.25,0:07:24.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇姑娘暂时躲着比较好
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.48,0:07:27.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,直到弄清楚奈落的企图为止
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.62,0:07:28.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说的也是
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.35,0:07:31.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总觉得很不安呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.19,0:07:32.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.93,0:07:40.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是什么人
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.50,0:07:45.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你穿的铠甲不错嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.37,0:07:46.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.22,0:08:03.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这景色怎么搞的…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.16,0:08:06.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好像似曾相识
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.53,0:08:13.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的回去比较好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.40,0:08:15.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个叫无双的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.67,0:08:17.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然不知道真实身分
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.67,0:08:20.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是他想要抓你对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.04,0:08:26.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是无双已经被犬夜叉的风之伤打倒了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.48,0:08:30.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对犬夜叉而言还真是用心
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.98,0:08:34.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然到目前为止 已经和奈落的分身交战过
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.25,0:08:37.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这还是他第一次这么小心
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.66,0:08:39.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落吗…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.39,0:08:41.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也有不祥的预感
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.46,0:08:44.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我去那个地方看看
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.73,0:08:45.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.76,0:08:47.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你先回家去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.23,0:08:50.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我到那个洞窟去
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.47,0:08:52.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,洞窟的话…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.77,0:08:54.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是那个吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.28,0:09:01.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.05,0:09:07.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,洞穴？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.89,0:09:21.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我…知道这里？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.04,0:09:25.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.07,0:09:26.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,干嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.14,0:09:29.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们的目的到底是哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.57,0:09:30.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落城…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.94,0:09:32.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有目标了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.64,0:09:34.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么可能
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.51,0:09:36.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就是胡乱走咯
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.41,0:09:38.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别说蠢话了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.42,0:09:41.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在朝无双来的 相反方向前进啦
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.85,0:09:44.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去被袭击的村子如何
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.66,0:09:48.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,强盗们被杀的地方也去看看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.93,0:09:53.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,神乐
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.97,0:09:58.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你来做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.87,0:10:01.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不是来打架的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.37,0:10:04.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是想告诉你们无双在哪
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.21,0:10:05.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无双？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.58,0:10:07.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那家伙还活着吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.58,0:10:10.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算我不知为何一直很在意他
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.88,0:10:13.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么你要来告诉我们这些
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.55,0:10:14.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道桔梗和鬼蜘蛛
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.99,0:10:17.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一起生活的洞窟吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.72,0:10:19.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无双正往那里去
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.12,0:10:21.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.36,0:10:23.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无双去了那个洞窟
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.63,0:10:25.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我确实的传达到了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.50,0:10:26.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再见
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.60,0:10:29.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等！是奈落唆使你的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.73,0:10:30.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.14,0:10:33.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落是否知道犬夜叉的秘…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.91,0:10:35.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别多嘴了 弥勒
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.11,0:10:37.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,秘密？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.51,0:10:41.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我…什么都没看到
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.42,0:10:48.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那女人到底在想什么
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.12,0:10:52.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,神乐似乎曾带着四魂碎片逃跑
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.99,0:10:56.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她应该不是绝对服从奈落
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.13,0:11:00.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,神乐没有告诉奈落吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.50,0:11:02.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉朔日的秘密
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.03,0:11:04.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算这样她也不是同伴！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.04,0:11:06.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是现在该怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.80,0:11:08.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无双吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.77,0:11:11.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然不能完全相信神乐说的话
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.64,0:11:14.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是稀奇
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.31,0:11:15.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是平常的犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.78,0:11:17.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一定马上就砍过去
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.88,0:11:19.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吵死了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.42,0:11:21.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.69,0:11:24.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉 你在急躁什么
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.69,0:11:26.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我才没有急躁
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.63,0:11:31.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总之就是会不由自主的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.16,0:11:33.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想到无双那家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.03,0:11:36.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那家伙什么跟什么嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.20,0:11:40.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我真搞不懂…奈落那家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.07,0:11:44.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去告诉犬夜叉他们无双的行踪
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.71,0:11:46.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后监视那家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.31,0:11:51.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,仿佛是要 监视那家伙的一举一动
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.08,0:11:54.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道无双和我不一样
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.22,0:11:56.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不受奈落的支配吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.73,0:12:04.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,枫姥姥
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.23,0:12:07.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇 你还没回去吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.47,0:12:10.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得 自己也想去看看那个洞窟
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.10,0:12:13.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就在前面了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.74,0:12:16.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.57,0:12:19.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里…曾经有谁
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.75,0:12:23.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那…到底是谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.88,0:12:27.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就是了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.85,0:12:32.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以前鬼蜘蛛待过那里
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.69,0:12:38.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里是…一切灾厄的起点
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.73,0:12:40.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.53,0:12:43.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 没什么
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.87,0:12:49.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想得到那女人
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.91,0:12:51.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.48,0:12:54.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我…的确在这里…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.65,0:12:57.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小心脚边
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.42,0:13:00.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要紧的 枫姥姥
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.35,0:13:02.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那女人
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.42,0:13:07.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对了 我想得到那个女人
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.29,0:13:10.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算向魔物出卖魂魄
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.56,0:13:13.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那女人
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.80,0:13:16.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那女人是…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.07,0:13:22.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桔梗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.51,0:13:24.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无双
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.78,0:13:25.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无双？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.81,0:13:28.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对了 我想起来了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.65,0:13:30.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想要得到桔梗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.65,0:13:37.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么可能！怎么会是那家伙？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.59,0:13:38.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,枫姥姥
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.82,0:13:41.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还记得那家伙散发的妖气
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.69,0:13:42.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是真让人难以致信
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.06,0:13:45.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那家伙为什么现在还活着
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.40,0:13:49.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别碍事 老太婆
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.53,0:13:51.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我有事要找那女人
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.77,0:13:54.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个拥有桔梗模样的女人
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.34,0:13:55.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,果然没错
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.67,0:13:57.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你果然是野盗鬼蜘蛛
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.04,0:13:59.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鬼蜘蛛？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.31,0:14:00.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别碍事
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.71,0:14:01.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要这样
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.81,0:14:03.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要找的人是我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.12,0:14:07.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我不会那么轻易被你抓到的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.12,0:14:09.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,枫姥姥 你快逃
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.79,0:14:11.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,站住！ 谁理你！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.32,0:14:12.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你到底是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.12,0:14:15.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拥有桔梗身影的你到底是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.96,0:14:17.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.23,0:14:21.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,散魂铁爪
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.43,0:14:23.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.97,0:14:30.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.08,0:14:32.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么还不回去
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.38,0:14:34.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你呀
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.75,0:14:37.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又来搅局啊 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.65,0:14:39.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.62,0:14:40.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.72,0:14:42.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇？为什么在这？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.75,0:14:44.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且还有无双也是
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.62,0:14:46.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我终于想起来了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.59,0:14:48.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以前当强盗时
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.99,0:14:51.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在这洞窟与桔梗度过的时光
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.16,0:14:54.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你到底在胡扯什么
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.77,0:14:57.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉 这家伙是鬼蜘蛛
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.77,0:15:00.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鬼蜘蛛就是向妖怪献上身体
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.04,0:15:03.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,构成奈落的大坏蛋吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.98,0:15:05.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还真敢说
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.14,0:15:07.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原来
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.65,0:15:10.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,受到严重烧伤的鬼蜘蛛
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.51,0:15:12.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,应该是没有脸的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.68,0:15:15.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以这家伙才会抢别人的脸
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.12,0:15:19.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,意思是鬼蜘蛛的心 从奈落体内跑出来了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.16,0:15:22.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所有的事我都想起来了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.76,0:15:25.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桔梗在那个时候死了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.56,0:15:26.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.90,0:15:28.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.30,0:15:30.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你伤害了桔梗吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.80,0:15:32.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,少胡说八道
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.30,0:15:33.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你以为我是了为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.77,0:15:36.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而让妖怪吞噬身体
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.07,0:15:40.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是想得到四魂之玉与自由的身体
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.44,0:15:45.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后带着桔梗 从这洞穴离开而已
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.52,0:15:48.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但在我得到全新的身体后
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.45,0:15:50.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,却完全事与愿违
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.52,0:15:54.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我从洞穴出来后 所做的第一件事
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.89,0:15:59.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,竟然是撕裂了 我不惜向妖怪出卖魂魄
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.33,0:16:01.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也想要得到的女人的身体
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.67,0:16:06.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落诞生的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.57,0:16:08.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还拥有鬼蜘蛛的意识吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.97,0:16:12.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落是大量妖怪的集合体
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.61,0:16:14.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些妖怪们最希望的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.81,0:16:17.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是身为巫女的姐姐的死
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.55,0:16:20.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弄到最后桔梗竟然
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.22,0:16:23.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,追随那半妖浑蛋之后而死
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.93,0:16:29.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桔梗死了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.99,0:16:33.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,四魂之玉也随着 桔梗的亡骸一起燃烧殆尽
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.00,0:16:35.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个时候…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.47,0:16:36.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,消失吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.50,0:16:40.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知道是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.87,0:16:44.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,将我监禁在深沉的黑暗中
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.51,0:16:47.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就是奈落吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.28,0:16:51.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,之后我不知沉睡了多久
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.88,0:16:52.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等到回过神来
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.12,0:16:56.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我已经被丢到外面的世界了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.62,0:16:59.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这家伙完全都不记得了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.29,0:17:00.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,连奈落也是…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.53,0:17:06.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你有从奈落那边接到命令吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.63,0:17:08.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我谁的命令都不听
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.93,0:17:10.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是看不顺眼的家伙就杀光
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.84,0:17:12.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后再烧光而已
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.57,0:17:13.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看最先
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.44,0:17:15.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉 就从你开始好了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.11,0:17:17.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么还活着
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.11,0:17:20.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桔梗明明已经死了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.18,0:17:22.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你才是
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.58,0:17:24.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,竟然挑这时候觉醒
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.68,0:17:26.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我先宰掉你
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.15,0:17:28.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,下一个就是那女人
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.05,0:17:29.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.09,0:17:31.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别对戈薇出手
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.96,0:17:33.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我来跟你打
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.06,0:17:37.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想跟我打啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.26,0:17:38.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,毒虫
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.63,0:17:40.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇姑娘与枫姥姥
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.23,0:17:41.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请你们先避一下
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.00,0:17:46.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然不知道 奈落为了什么放你出来
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.77,0:17:49.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对我来说你和奈落都一样
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.64,0:17:52.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是桔梗的仇人
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.41,0:17:53.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,少废话
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.18,0:18:01.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伤口愈合了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.19,0:18:03.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原来如此！无双的身体
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.62,0:18:06.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拥有与众不同的再生能力
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.22,0:18:07.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,少臭屁了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.19,0:18:13.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看样子你那把怪里怪气的刀
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.23,0:18:15.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,根本就砍不了我
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.63,0:18:16.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,浑蛋…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.93,0:18:18.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,本来这种对手
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.64,0:18:21.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的风穴应该能派上用场的…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.44,0:18:23.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落在保护鬼蜘蛛吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.11,0:18:25.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,应该是
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.48,0:18:29.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放出毒虫 就等于是封住了我的风穴
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.28,0:18:30.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是无双明明说
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.71,0:18:33.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他根本不听奈落的命令吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.95,0:18:36.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也不清楚奈落的目的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.96,0:18:47.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又来了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.27,0:18:49.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.00,0:18:53.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我真不想直接和你见面
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.30,0:18:54.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有什么事
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.74,0:18:56.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来找你试试
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.51,0:18:58.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我现在的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.04,0:19:00.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我应该说过了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.78,0:19:04.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这个拥有鬼蜘蛛的心的半妖
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.22,0:19:05.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是杀不了我的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.85,0:19:08.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鬼蜘蛛的心吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.75,0:19:09.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,的确
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.95,0:19:13.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要我还残留着鬼蜘蛛的心
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.19,0:19:15.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就无法对桔梗出手
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.46,0:19:18.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算那是假造的身体也一样
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.96,0:19:19.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这家伙…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.00,0:19:21.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我明知道这一点
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.77,0:19:25.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是身体就是无法对你出手
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.84,0:19:31.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那以土块与骨头所构成的你
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.79,0:19:49.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了 奈落
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.73,0:19:52.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不杀了我吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.50,0:19:55.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别得意忘形了 桔梗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.77,0:19:59.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不杀你不是因为害怕你的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.07,0:20:02.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是我自己的问题
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.81,0:20:06.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且也不是杀了你
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.08,0:20:09.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而是毁了你
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.31,0:20:13.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看样子 我还不能切断与鬼蜘蛛的因缘
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.24,0:20:33.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么啦
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.11,0:20:37.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,风之伤
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.78,0:20:42.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,成功了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.11,0:20:44.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.62,0:20:46.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那家伙的再生能力实在…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.93,0:20:56.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有用的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.70,0:20:59.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,风之伤
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.17,0:21:08.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.91,0:21:12.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就不信他每次都能再生
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.38,0:21:15.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是这样就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.08,0:21:17.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无双那浑蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.45,0:21:20.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说他根本不听奈落的命令
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.12,0:21:23.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那家伙不受奈落的控制吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.22,0:21:25.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明明是奈落的分身
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.86,0:21:27.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么可能做得到
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.39,0:21:30.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.59,0:21:32.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管砍几次都没用
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.96,0:21:34.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还不懂吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.20,0:21:37.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又复活了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.00,0:21:39.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.34,0:21:42.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的没有打倒这家伙的方法吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.17,0:21:46.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他又变化了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.91,0:21:51.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.12,0:21:55.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也渐渐习惯这个身体了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.42,0:21:59.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉 上面！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.86,0:22:04.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.24,0:22:20.38,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,究竟要流多少泪{\fad(500,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.19,0:22:27.15,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Every Heart  才能坦白面对自己
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.99,0:22:34.02,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,倘若对谁传达情感
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.77,0:22:40.93,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Every Heart  是否就能得到满足{\fad(50,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.24,0:22:47.40,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,害怕着漫长漫长的夜晚
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.71,0:22:54.24,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,朝着遥远的星星祈祷着{\fad(0,250)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.95,0:23:01.19,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在不停流转的时空之中
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.96,0:23:07.80,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们都在寻找真正的爱
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.47,0:23:14.84,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,希望自己能够变得更坚强
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.11,0:23:21.51,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天也要抬头看着高高的天空{\fad(0,100)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.01,0:23:28.08,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在不停流转的时空之中{\fad(150,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.79,0:23:34.49,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们都在寻找生命的意义{\fad(0,350)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.03,0:23:50.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鬼蜘蛛的心还活着
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.24,0:23:52.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落将这麻烦的部分舍弃
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.31,0:23:53.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而产生了无双
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.77,0:23:55.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是好奇怪 戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.14,0:23:57.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落想要保护无双
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.21,0:23:59.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,既然是不要的东西 应该放着不管才对
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.55,0:24:01.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落想要将无双吸入体内
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.75,0:24:03.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无双的爪子贯穿了奈落
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.52,0:24:04.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.55,0:24:06.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落与无双是敌人吗
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.55,0:24:08.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,次回 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.02,0:24:10.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一场混乱的死斗
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.02,0:24:14.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一切的关键 就在于他们背上的蜘蛛
